The Microsoft C/C++ runtime (CRT) is linked statically under the Visual Studio redistribution terms.

## SKSE Menu Framework header

`SL_MagicMenu.dll` compiles in the API header of SKSE Menu Framework 2 (Thiago099/SKSE-Menu-Framework-2-Example @ `cd1f277`,
changed to look the framework's DLL up when a function is first used). It resolves every call from `SKSEMenuFramework.dll` at run
time; SKSE Menu Framework itself is not included and stays optional (without it there is no settings tab; the ini keys work as
before). The header's license:

```
